[Tips.縁取りσ]
effect.name=Places border effects around the opaque pixels of the object. Compared to the standard Border filter, it offers more flexible settings and is faster.
方式=Algorithm used for calculation
α調整=Meaning depends on Method
inner::左端を延伸=Creates inner border as if the opaque pixels on the edge extend to the outside.
inner::右端を延伸=Creates inner border as if the opaque pixels on the edge extend to the outside.
inner::上端を延伸=Creates inner border as if the opaque pixels on the edge extend to the outside.
inner::下端を延伸=Creates inner border as if the opaque pixels on the edge extend to the outside.
縦横比=Positive: vertically long / Negative: horizontally long
凸半径=Rounds the outer protruding parts.
凹半径=Adds rounded parts to the inner cutouts.
膨らみ=Uses superellipse instead of circle.\n-300 ⇒ Cross\n0 ⇒ Rhombus\n+100 ⇒ Circle\n+300 ⇒ Rectangle

