[Tips.アウトラインσ]
effect.name=Creates a line of a specified width along the boundary of the object.
距離=Distance between the line and the object
方式=Algorithm used for calculation
α調整=Meaning depends on Method
ライン配置=Effective when Source Transparency is less than 100.
内側透明度=Transparency of the "hole" part of the outline
距離縦横比=Positive: vertically long / Negative: horizontally long
凸半径=Rounds the outer protruding parts.
凹半径=Adds rounded parts to the inner cutouts.
距離膨らみ=Uses superellipse instead of circle.\n-300 ⇒ Cross\n0 ⇒ Rhombus\n+100 ⇒ Circle\n+300 ⇒ Rectangle
ライン縦横比=Positive: vertically long / Negative: horizontally long
ライン膨らみ=Uses superellipse instead of circle.\n-300 ⇒ Cross\n0 ⇒ Rhombus\n+100 ⇒ Circle\n+300 ⇒ Rectangle
手順=Valid when both Convex Radius and Concave Radius are positive.

